DESCRIPTION:Topic	:	Zumba x Bollywood	\nSynopsis	:	Looking for a fun and ch
	ill way to sweat out the stress from the day? Join us for Zumba X Bollywoo
	d dance workout to boost your cardio endurance\, improve core strength\, a
	nd unwind your body with us!	\nSpeakers	:	Mr Ajay Surendra MATHUR \, Head 
	of CBG & Wealth Mgmt (HKMC member)\nMs Betty Lam\, Head of HR (HKMC member
	)\nExternal Instructor (details to be confirmed)	\n\n\n\n_________________
	__________________________________________________________________________
	___________________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a laptop or mob
	ile device through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Mee
	ting Link  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m1adfa73e1d39e3b2b688a2b7
	72239d2e> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit here  <https:
	//dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-tools.aspx?mar
	ket=Singapore&category=Communication> to find out more about Webex \n\nMee
	ting password: ktPtvawt827 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If you are join
	ing via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1. Press the 
	"Call" icon\n2. Dial 25189162772@dbs.webex.com into the search bar and pre
	ss "Call" \n3. If you are the host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY.
	 Click here to see how to retrieve your Host KEY  <https://dbs1bank.sharep
	oint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsite
	s%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2F
	Guides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Guide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D
	42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2F
	Guides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through t
	he Web browser: \nFor external parties who do not wish to download the app
	lication \n1. Click on this hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link  <https://dbs.we
	bex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m1adfa73e1d39e3b2b688a2b772239d2e> \n2. Click on 
	‘Cancel button’ if a popup ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Jo
	in from your browser’ \n4. Enter your Name and Email Address and join th
	e meeting \n\nClick here  <https://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/J
	oin-a-Webex-Meeting> to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling 
	in via phone (audio only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may appl
	y.\nNote if you are the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to start th
	e meeting.\nSingapore +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nH
	ong Kong +852-3018-6828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumb
	ai +91-22-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hydera
	bad +91-40-6480-0114 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2
	-5594-0839 <tel:%2B886-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2518 
	916 2772#\nGlobal call-in numbers  <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin
	.php> \n\n\nUseful Links:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team!  <mailto
